Third-party colpkg fixtures
===========================

Three files in this directory were copied from other repositories and are
still those copies. SHA-256 of each file matches the upstream file on the
commit below (checked 2026-11-18 against the raw file on the default branch,
which is unchanged since that commit). The paths are the ones recorded in
tools/arm64-smoke/make_expected.py. A later change may replace these with
synthetic decks. This file describes the copies that are here now.

The MIT license below is the license of the source repository. It is not a
finding that every byte inside a deck (notes, audio, images) is MIT.

